@HostAddress = http://127.0.0.1:5000
@Cookie = YOUR_GEMINI_COOKIES_HERE

### Health Check (无需鉴权)
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/health

### List Models (模型列表 - 包含 4 Argon、3.8 Flash、3.5 Flash-Lite、3.1 Pro 等)
GET {{HostAddress}}/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{Cookie}}

### Chat Completion - 3.8 Flash (推荐最强思考模型)
POST {{HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Cookie}}

{
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Which is bigger: 9.9 or 9.11? Explain your reasoning."
    }
  ]
}

### Chat Completion - 3.5 Flash-Lite (轻量极速模型)
POST {{HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Cookie}}

{
  "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Summarize the theory of relativity in one sentence."
    }
  ]
}

### Chat Completion - 3.1 Pro (高精度专业推理)
POST {{HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Cookie}}

{
  "model": "gemini-3.1-pro",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Write a Python function to solve the Two Sum problem with O(n) complexity."
    }
  ]
}

### Chat Completion - 4 Argon (下一代前沿实验模型)
POST {{HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Cookie}}

{
  "model": "gemini-4-argon",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "What are the latest breakthroughs in quantum computing?"
    }
  ]
}

### Chat Completion - Streaming (实时流式 SSE 问答)
POST {{HostAddress}}/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Cookie}}

{
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a poetic assistant."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Write a 4-line poem about artificial intelligence."
    }
  ],
  "stream": true
}
